WEBVTT

00:10.870 --> 00:12.990
What a lovely morning!

00:13.920 --> 00:17.910
If only Onii-chan would get up early for once to see it.

00:21.600 --> 00:23.340
Oh, g'morning.

00:28.610 --> 00:31.840
You're... awake.

00:35.770 --> 00:39.150
B-Better make sure the disaster kit's stocked up!

00:39.150 --> 00:41.020
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:44.260 --> 00:46.260
SPACENOID

00:46.260 --> 00:47.840
What's here is gone

00:47.840 --> 00:49.360
What's gone is here

00:49.360 --> 00:50.540
Today a cucumber, tomorrow a clam

00:50.540 --> 00:52.500
Gotta check my trousers, trance, trance, trance

00:52.500 --> 00:54.030
What's his is gone

00:54.030 --> 00:55.580
What's hers is here

00:55.580 --> 00:58.290
My pronouns are in shambles!

00:58.660 --> 01:01.670
Gone are the days of making wagies seethe

01:01.670 --> 01:04.590
(Bye-bye alright! I'm still unemployable!)

01:04.590 --> 01:07.880
Without balls I just can't get up for it

01:07.880 --> 01:10.850
(Scratch that, grow a pair! I won't stand for this!)

01:10.850 --> 01:16.570
Ah, having peered into a queer new world

01:16.570 --> 01:22.000
I've been bewitched by its siren song

01:23.210 --> 01:29.160
I dove right in and the water's great

01:29.160 --> 01:32.490
Cute outfits, makeup galore, and hairstyles aplenty

01:32.490 --> 01:37.590
The world of women is calling my name

01:38.290 --> 01:41.800
Wait, I'm a dude! Or am I?

01:39.080 --> 01:39.830
(Who!)

01:39.880 --> 01:40.540
(Are!)

01:41.240 --> 01:41.800
(It's me!)

01:41.800 --> 01:45.170
Some part of my identity is crumbling

01:45.170 --> 01:47.550
Leading to a newborn sense of wonder

01:47.940 --> 01:51.350
As an unknown sensation pervades my psyche

01:51.350 --> 01:54.350
Awaken, my inner cute girl!

01:54.350 --> 01:57.570
With proper stimulation comes a happy ending?

01:57.570 --> 01:59.070
What's here is gone

01:59.070 --> 02:00.400
What's gone is here

02:00.400 --> 02:01.770
Today a cucumber, tomorrow a clam

02:01.770 --> 02:03.720
Gotta check my trousers, trance, trance, trance

02:03.720 --> 02:05.240
What's his is gone

02:05.240 --> 02:06.800
What's hers is here

02:06.800 --> 02:10.380
My manhood's in total shambles!

02:10.380 --> 02:10.990
ERGZAY

02:11.480 --> 02:16.490
#05 Mahiro Discovers Adventure and Social Gatherings

02:11.770 --> 02:16.910
They're selling sheet protectors of my fave anime at the corner store today.

02:18.420 --> 02:21.990
The popular characters tend to get snatched up quick, you know?

02:19.820 --> 02:20.170
Magical Fleet
Love★Master

02:23.480 --> 02:26.540
It means neglecting my duty as home security officer, of course,

02:28.620 --> 02:31.440
but materialism won out in the end.

02:32.240 --> 02:33.960
Wait, hold on...

02:33.960 --> 02:36.430
D-Does that mean you're...

02:36.430 --> 02:37.670
Yup.

02:37.670 --> 02:39.390
I'm headed out right now.

02:42.740 --> 02:44.920
Y-You're actually...

02:45.520 --> 02:47.970
leaving the house of your own volition...

02:49.940 --> 02:52.110
Oh, no! The waterworks!

02:52.110 --> 02:54.660
And you got up early!

02:54.660 --> 02:56.590
You even made breakfast all by yourself!

02:56.590 --> 02:58.790
Okay, okay! I get it, all right?

02:58.790 --> 03:01.040
Try and pull yourself together!

03:02.540 --> 03:06.330
I'll treat you to a nice lunch when you get back, okay?!

03:06.330 --> 03:09.340
I'm just going to the corner store.

03:10.700 --> 03:12.740
Have a nice day!

03:24.870 --> 03:27.130
I managed to get them all,

03:27.130 --> 03:29.220
but getting there required quite the scavenger hunt.

03:29.220 --> 03:32.280
I ended up having to come all the way out here to the station.

03:32.750 --> 03:35.190
I thought about giving up and going home,

03:35.190 --> 03:38.200
but I didn't wanna disappoint Mihari after all the fuss she made.

03:40.690 --> 03:41.500
Huh?

03:43.120 --> 03:44.390
Hey, take a look.

03:48.710 --> 03:49.780
Hm?

03:57.250 --> 03:59.650
I-I should head back.

04:13.740 --> 04:15.960
This time I'm gonna beat your ass!

04:13.960 --> 04:15.320
C'mon, let's go!

04:14.820 --> 04:17.360
I've gotten way better, just so you know.

04:18.090 --> 04:21.320
An arcade, huh?

04:21.320 --> 04:24.520
Woohoo! What a blast from the past!

04:24.520 --> 04:27.500
I used to come to these a ton back when I was in middle school!

04:27.880 --> 04:30.920
Wow! Yeah!

04:31.540 --> 04:32.800
He's cornered!

04:32.800 --> 04:33.840
Yeah, go in for the punch!

04:34.530 --> 04:35.460
That's it!

04:35.460 --> 04:36.760
You got this! You got this!

04:36.760 --> 04:38.660
Yeah! Get him!

04:39.120 --> 04:40.180
I can still win this!

04:40.180 --> 04:43.240
Almost, almost!

04:43.240 --> 04:44.970
Hell yeah!

04:44.970 --> 04:49.310
M-Maybe I'll skip the fighting games for now...

04:49.310 --> 04:50.520
Hm?

04:50.520 --> 04:50.560
Capturing every facet

04:50.520 --> 04:50.560
of your beauty.

04:50.520 --> 04:50.560
Become the person of your dreams.

04:50.520 --> 04:50.560
Your best self ♥

04:51.620 --> 04:54.940
Selfie Corner
Boys by themselves or in a group of boys
may not enter the selfie corner.
If you are accompanied by a girl, you may enter.

04:56.920 --> 04:59.210
I-I'm allowed in here, right?

04:59.210 --> 05:01.200
Since I'm a girl right now and all.

05:01.200 --> 05:03.770
Wow, it's a whole new world!

05:03.770 --> 05:05.650
I'm kinda getting a rush!

05:09.400 --> 05:12.540
Can't hurt to give it a go, right?

05:12.540 --> 05:14.890
Hey! You can add stickers!

05:15.760 --> 05:17.720
My eyes look huge!

05:17.720 --> 05:20.200
Is this what they mean by "instaworthy"?

05:21.750 --> 05:23.750
Kokokara

05:22.340 --> 05:24.000
They're done!

05:31.560 --> 05:32.770
Wait!

05:32.770 --> 05:35.320
What the hell am I even doing?!

05:35.320 --> 05:36.700
So then my boyfriend was like...

05:36.700 --> 05:38.120
No way! For real?!

05:38.120 --> 05:39.400
What a jerk!

05:39.400 --> 05:42.400
I-I'm sorry!

05:52.410 --> 05:55.380
Man, I love these kinds of games.

05:58.340 --> 05:59.130
Huh?

05:59.790 --> 06:02.760
<i>I-Is somebody watching me?</i>

06:06.090 --> 06:08.420
<i>He's still there!</i>

06:11.520 --> 06:13.670
<i>B-But why?!</i>

06:13.670 --> 06:16.440
<i>It's not like I'm that good at it.</i>

06:17.400 --> 06:20.610
<i>O-Oh, no! Is it because I'm a girl?!</i>

06:22.480 --> 06:25.320
<i>Ugh, one of those desperate types!</i>

06:25.320 --> 06:28.610
<i>Girls who play rhythm games probably seem like easy targets...</i>

06:28.610 --> 06:31.810
<i>Th-This sucks!</i>

06:33.620 --> 06:35.420
All right, you.

06:37.270 --> 06:39.480
I-I-I'm sorry, but I'm not the kind of girl—

06:39.480 --> 06:40.750
I mean, guy—

06:40.750 --> 06:44.720
I mean, girl you're after!

06:46.150 --> 06:47.110
Huh?

06:54.960 --> 06:57.090
Young lady, shouldn't you be in school?

06:57.090 --> 06:59.540
Huh? S-School?

06:59.540 --> 07:00.920
Which school do you go to?

07:00.920 --> 07:02.900
U-Um... Err...

07:03.590 --> 07:05.820
What's your name? What year are you?

07:06.850 --> 07:09.240
U-Uh... Um...

07:09.790 --> 07:12.660
Can you tell me where your parents are?

07:12.660 --> 07:16.080
No, no, no, no...

07:19.900 --> 07:23.960
I told you the outside world was scary!

07:23.960 --> 07:25.430
There, there...

07:26.200 --> 07:27.780
You got a talking-to, huh?

07:27.780 --> 07:30.350
I guess today <i>is</i> a weekday. It slipped my mind.

07:30.960 --> 07:33.890
Just when you finally ventured outside on your own, too.

07:33.890 --> 07:36.270
If I'm not careful, we'll be right back where we started.

07:37.210 --> 07:40.060
I need to fix this somehow.

07:41.030 --> 07:42.900
Sho cuuute!

07:42.520 --> 07:42.560
ONIMAI

07:53.330 --> 07:55.030
Oh, you've got split ends.

07:55.030 --> 07:56.210
Huh?

07:56.210 --> 07:57.580
C'mere a sec.

08:00.080 --> 08:02.400
It's because you don't take proper care of it.

08:03.620 --> 08:06.660
No, it's because it's unnecessarily long!

08:06.660 --> 08:09.440
Forget that tiny thing, and let's chop it all off instead!

08:09.440 --> 08:11.000
No way! Not a chance!

08:11.000 --> 08:14.600
Don't you realize how difficult it is to grow your hair out that long?!

08:14.600 --> 08:17.310
Huh? But mine grew out in one night...

08:18.140 --> 08:21.860
Still, I guess it <i>is</i> getting a little long...

08:21.860 --> 08:22.620
Wha?

08:25.050 --> 08:27.900
All right! We're going to the hair salon!

08:27.900 --> 08:29.660
The hair salon?!

08:35.970 --> 08:37.870
Welcome!

08:37.870 --> 08:38.790
Oh!

08:39.610 --> 08:40.790
What's this?

08:40.790 --> 08:43.290
That was quick. Weren't you just here the other day?

08:43.290 --> 08:46.210
Oh, no. It's not for me this time.

08:46.650 --> 08:49.500
Could you work your magic on her today?

08:52.310 --> 08:55.090
Sure thing. Right this way.

08:55.810 --> 09:00.230
This is too much for a mere home security officer to take.

09:01.790 --> 09:04.370
How about a two-inch trim?

09:04.370 --> 09:05.390
Sound good?

09:05.390 --> 09:06.290
Hyup!

09:06.980 --> 09:08.150
It's not too tight, is it?

09:09.000 --> 09:11.250
Let me know if anything feels off, okay?

09:18.560 --> 09:20.740
So you're Mihari-chan's little sister, right?

09:20.740 --> 09:23.440
Your big sis comes here quite often, you know?

09:23.440 --> 09:25.670
O-Oh, really?

09:26.100 --> 09:28.740
Is this your first time coming to a hair salon?

09:28.740 --> 09:30.380
Y-Yeah...

09:30.380 --> 09:31.900
You in middle school?

09:33.510 --> 09:35.730
It's been getting cold out recently, huh?

09:35.730 --> 09:37.020
U-Uh...

09:37.020 --> 09:39.210
What do you like to do on your days off?

09:39.210 --> 09:40.720
U-Um...

09:41.870 --> 09:43.740
Do you go out with your friends?

09:49.070 --> 09:52.200
Okey-doke, are you happy with the length?

09:52.200 --> 09:54.630
It's finally over.

09:54.630 --> 09:58.080
Time for a quick shampoo, then. Follow me.

09:58.080 --> 09:59.230
Okay...

09:59.230 --> 10:00.660
Wait, there's more?!

10:02.090 --> 10:04.080
Got places to be, huh?

10:09.830 --> 10:11.800
Does it feel itchy at all anywhere?

10:12.310 --> 10:14.840
No, not at all...

10:14.840 --> 10:17.650
Long hair can be a hassle, huh?

10:17.650 --> 10:20.270
But it's worth it when you have gorgeous hair like yours.

10:33.410 --> 10:36.910
<i>Maybe the hair salon isn't so bad after all...</i>

10:41.750 --> 10:42.790
Huh?!

10:42.790 --> 10:44.500
Oh! Is it too hot?

10:44.920 --> 10:46.830
N-No! Not at all!

10:46.830 --> 10:48.710
Not one bit!

10:49.090 --> 10:53.950
<i>S-Scratch that, it rules!</i>

10:58.210 --> 11:00.970
Phew, I feel all refreshed now.

11:00.970 --> 11:03.430
Now for your hair treatment.

11:03.430 --> 11:04.730
Wha?!

11:04.730 --> 11:07.330
Their parfaits are so good.

11:07.330 --> 11:11.040
They have so many options,
I can never decide what to get.

11:11.040 --> 11:15.620
I really recommend their strawberry affogato one.

11:15.620 --> 11:17.740
And their ruby chocolate sherbet, too.

11:17.740 --> 11:21.490
Oh, and that limited-edition Shine Muscat grape flavor they did once!

11:21.490 --> 11:24.310
You really should give them a try sometime!

11:23.840 --> 11:24.950
<i>Ugh...</i>

11:25.300 --> 11:29.480
<i>I-I can't take this anymore!</i>

11:29.480 --> 11:31.890
<i>She leaves me no other choice...</i>

11:31.890 --> 11:32.890
<i>It's nap time.</i>

11:35.610 --> 11:37.180
Mahiro-chan!

11:37.180 --> 11:38.790
Mahiro-chan!

11:40.430 --> 11:43.890
Wake up, Mahiro-chan! You're all set.

11:44.800 --> 11:45.770
Huh?

11:49.270 --> 11:50.130
Wha—

11:50.900 --> 11:54.240
What did she do to me?!

11:54.540 --> 11:58.730
You weren't waking up,
so I asked her to give you a blowout.

11:59.260 --> 12:02.370
You look great! Just like a princess!

12:02.370 --> 12:04.160
Right?

12:04.160 --> 12:06.590
Like a princess?!

12:12.010 --> 12:14.480
Oh? So you like it, huh?

12:14.480 --> 12:16.440
I-I never said that!

12:24.810 --> 12:27.440
Does it feel nice to get all dolled up?

12:27.440 --> 12:29.650
N-Not especially...

12:31.910 --> 12:34.520
Will it stay all poofy like this forever?

12:35.690 --> 12:38.010
It's not a perm, so probably not.

12:38.010 --> 12:39.700
It depends on your hair type,

12:39.700 --> 12:41.570
but styling usually doesn't hold up that long.

12:44.340 --> 12:46.900
There's always doing it yourself at home,

12:46.900 --> 12:48.250
but it can be a pain to keep up.

12:48.640 --> 12:53.120
And getting a hairdresser to do it every time can get a little pricey, too.

12:59.630 --> 13:01.600
Th-That's steep.

13:05.360 --> 13:06.980
<i>Onimai.</i>

13:09.380 --> 13:10.980
<i>Onimai.</i>

13:14.970 --> 13:15.900
Yeah?

13:19.380 --> 13:20.850
Okay, okay.

13:20.850 --> 13:24.740
What's with you? You usually just come barging right in.

13:32.930 --> 13:35.650
Wh-Wh-Wh-What the hell?!

13:36.420 --> 13:39.130
Help! S-Somebody help!

13:49.080 --> 13:49.950
Huh?

13:50.900 --> 13:52.910
It's a costume, silly!

13:54.400 --> 13:56.520
Today's Halloween, remember?

13:59.550 --> 14:02.320
Who cares about some stupid holiday?!

14:02.320 --> 14:05.290
I hate celebrating those kinds of things!

14:05.290 --> 14:06.970
Aww!

14:06.970 --> 14:10.320
But Kaede's having a party at her place.

14:10.320 --> 14:11.090
Huh?

14:11.750 --> 14:14.520
I take it you're not coming, then, Onii-chan?

14:15.960 --> 14:17.930
Well, what's it gonna be?

14:26.080 --> 14:28.430
T-T-T-T—

14:28.820 --> 14:32.210
Trick or... treat!

14:32.210 --> 14:33.270
Rawr!

14:36.980 --> 14:39.400
You're so cute!

14:42.540 --> 14:45.380
Halloween rules!

14:46.710 --> 14:50.070
Gosh, Mahiro-chan! You really went the extra mile, huh?

14:50.070 --> 14:51.050
Wait, what?

14:52.450 --> 14:54.270
Am I the only one wearing a costume?

14:54.850 --> 14:55.960
Huh?

14:56.360 --> 14:59.880
But Mihari told me it was a costume party.

14:59.880 --> 15:00.620
Right?

15:02.800 --> 15:05.720
You tricked me!

15:06.050 --> 15:07.600
This is so embarrassing...

15:07.600 --> 15:09.850
Who cares? You look cute!

15:09.850 --> 15:10.790
Oh, goodness...

15:10.790 --> 15:13.570
So what have you come dressed as, Mihari?

15:13.570 --> 15:15.350
This isn't a costume.

15:15.350 --> 15:16.150
Yeah, I know.

15:17.230 --> 15:19.820
Heh, she gotcha good!

15:23.240 --> 15:26.130
Okay, then. The two of us are gonna prepare dinner,

15:26.130 --> 15:28.120
so why don't you guys go play for a bit?

15:28.120 --> 15:29.350
Okay!

15:30.920 --> 15:32.480
What do you wanna do?

15:32.480 --> 15:35.160
I kinda want to get out of this first.

15:35.510 --> 15:37.960
I can lend you something, if you want.

15:37.960 --> 15:39.590
Wanna go to my room?

15:39.590 --> 15:41.630
Y-Your room?!

15:41.630 --> 15:42.440
Yeah.

15:42.440 --> 15:45.760
Oh, but I wouldn't wanna impose...

15:45.760 --> 15:48.570
Come on, don't be silly.

15:48.570 --> 15:49.680
Whoops—

15:57.510 --> 15:59.870
The room of a girl I barely know.

15:59.870 --> 16:01.440
So...

16:01.440 --> 16:04.590
I don't really have anything cutesy.

16:04.590 --> 16:06.260
Thanks.

16:09.030 --> 16:11.200
That's too bad, though.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.370
What is?

16:13.200 --> 16:16.910
I really wanted to see Kaede-chan in a costume.

16:16.910 --> 16:18.370
Oh...

16:18.770 --> 16:21.710
She does have a nice figure, huh?

16:21.710 --> 16:22.750
<i>Boing!</i>

16:22.750 --> 16:23.920
<i>Jiggle!</i>

16:24.340 --> 16:25.840
<i>Wow!</i>

16:28.750 --> 16:30.600
And then there's me...

16:33.530 --> 16:36.200
I-I'm sure yours will grow in sooner or later!

16:36.200 --> 16:38.060
You two are sisters, right?!

16:39.100 --> 16:41.730
I feel like she's hogging all the good genes.

16:41.730 --> 16:44.430
Huh? No way!

16:44.430 --> 16:47.280
I envy you, Mahiro-chan. At least you have <i>some</i>.

16:47.280 --> 16:47.980
Wha?!

16:48.840 --> 16:51.380
Y-You think so?

16:51.380 --> 16:54.710
Mihari's certainly aren't small...

16:54.710 --> 16:57.860
Does that mean I have room to grow too?

16:57.860 --> 17:01.630
Wait! What am I even saying?!

17:02.600 --> 17:05.340
What's wrong? Are you okay?

17:05.340 --> 17:07.220
<i>C-Crap!</i>

17:07.220 --> 17:09.260
<i>I've been forgetting myself too easily lately!</i>

17:10.170 --> 17:15.390
<i>You're a man, remember?!
Get those dirty cogwheels turning!</i>

17:16.180 --> 17:17.140
Hey...

17:17.510 --> 17:20.850
Do you think it's true that rubbing them makes them grow bigger?

17:20.850 --> 17:21.940
Wha?

17:22.610 --> 17:23.960
Well, do you?

17:23.960 --> 17:25.940
Uh... Um...

17:26.500 --> 17:29.610
Oh, no, not in a weird way...

17:30.090 --> 17:32.280
Oh, right...

17:39.930 --> 17:41.060
Okay, you two!

17:41.060 --> 17:43.630
Come help set the table!

17:43.990 --> 17:44.750
Hm?

17:49.970 --> 17:53.260
Wow! There's pumpkins galore!

17:53.260 --> 17:56.330
Ugh, but I don't like pumpkin...

17:56.330 --> 17:57.630
Now, now.

17:57.630 --> 17:59.500
At least give it a try.

18:06.860 --> 18:08.610
It's yummy!

18:09.020 --> 18:11.120
You never disappoint, Kaede-chan!

18:11.120 --> 18:12.940
I know, right?

18:13.530 --> 18:16.330
I cooked too, you know?

18:16.330 --> 18:17.950
What's that?

18:17.950 --> 18:20.780
It's stir-fried chicken and pumpkin in mustard.

18:25.220 --> 18:27.730
Wow, it's surprisingly good!

18:28.720 --> 18:30.130
Surprisingly?

18:30.130 --> 18:32.300
Oh, my gosh! It really is!

18:33.220 --> 18:35.450
It's delicious!

18:35.450 --> 18:37.880
You're such a sweetheart, Momiji-chan.

18:44.150 --> 18:46.110
Hm? What's so funny?

18:46.110 --> 18:49.430
I was just thinking it's been a while since we had dinner in a group like this.

18:49.430 --> 18:52.820
Oh, right. Your parents have been overseas for a while now, haven't they?

18:53.520 --> 18:55.740
Doesn't your brother ever come home to visit?

18:56.960 --> 18:59.200
Wh-Where did that come from?!

18:59.680 --> 19:03.700
You told me he was going to a college far away from home.

19:03.700 --> 19:05.630
Oh, um, um, um...

19:05.630 --> 19:07.370
Oh! Oh, yes!

19:07.370 --> 19:10.230
Yes, that's right! College!

19:10.230 --> 19:12.800
Studying really takes up most of his time these days, you know?

19:12.800 --> 19:16.010
I don't think I ever got to meet him.

19:16.010 --> 19:20.010
You used to talk about him all the time back in middle school.

19:20.010 --> 19:20.780
What?

19:20.780 --> 19:22.730
O-Oh, did I?

19:23.060 --> 19:24.500
Anyways! Um...

19:24.500 --> 19:27.110
Oh, a trip!

19:27.110 --> 19:29.150
Why don't we all go on a trip together?!

19:29.640 --> 19:32.100
I'd be down, but where to?

19:32.100 --> 19:34.440
Since it's winter, why not skiing?

19:34.440 --> 19:35.430
Skiing?

19:35.430 --> 19:36.950
No way! Anything but that!

19:37.360 --> 19:40.020
I say we go down south to the tropical islands

19:40.020 --> 19:43.800
and lounge around in an air-conditioned hotel room!

19:43.800 --> 19:45.550
Sounds kinda fancy!

19:45.550 --> 19:48.720
Traveling down south can get a little expensive, though.

19:48.720 --> 19:51.830
How about we just book a stay at a nearby onsen instead?

19:51.830 --> 19:55.400
An onsen, huh? A hot spring does sound nice.

19:55.400 --> 19:56.910
Doesn't it?

19:56.910 --> 19:59.440
Yeah, going to a hot spring with Mahiro-chan sounds fun!

19:58.470 --> 20:00.760
A hot spring inn it is!

20:05.690 --> 20:09.560
Phew, I'm stuffed! That was so good.

20:09.980 --> 20:12.720
See? I knew you'd have fun!

20:12.720 --> 20:14.920
By the way, about what Kaede said...

20:14.920 --> 20:17.160
Oh, that? Um...

20:17.570 --> 20:21.420
Honestly, I have no idea what kinda things you said behind my back,

20:22.130 --> 20:25.250
but I suppose there's no point bringing it up now.

20:26.280 --> 20:28.360
I wasn't bad-mouthing you.

20:29.700 --> 20:31.720
Hm? Did you say something?

20:31.720 --> 20:33.660
Nothing at all.

20:37.930 --> 20:39.550
<i>Onimai.</i>

20:42.870 --> 20:44.470
Jeez.

20:44.890 --> 20:47.890
Another day loafing about doing nothing, is it?

20:48.540 --> 20:51.250
You could at least go outside and play!

20:51.250 --> 20:53.690
Who are you? Mom?!

20:53.690 --> 20:57.820
Besides, what if I get caught by another truant officer, huh?

21:00.240 --> 21:02.580
Life is so cruel.

21:03.190 --> 21:06.660
Keeping me locked up at home playing video games like this.

21:08.760 --> 21:13.690
<i>He's been making great strides by getting out more recently,</i>

21:13.690 --> 21:17.090
<i>but if he keeps this up,
he'll be a freeloader his whole life.</i>

21:17.090 --> 21:19.400
Rolly polly, rolly polly.

21:18.030 --> 21:23.010
<i>I was hoping to avoid this,
but I think it's time to execute plan B.</i>

21:19.840 --> 21:23.010
Rolly polly, rolly polly.

21:23.420 --> 21:25.200
<i>Where to start...</i>

21:31.650 --> 21:33.400
Look who it is!

21:34.030 --> 21:36.850
Mahiro-chan? Yeah, she's here!

21:36.850 --> 21:37.680
Hm?

21:38.520 --> 21:41.200
Maybe that's Momiji.

21:41.200 --> 21:42.490
Upsa-daisy.

21:45.330 --> 21:47.380
Hey, what's up?

21:47.380 --> 21:48.930
Hey, Mahiro-chan!

21:48.930 --> 21:50.050
Momi—

21:50.050 --> 21:51.000
Huh?

22:01.220 --> 22:03.590
Wh-Who the hell—?!

23:38.250 --> 23:39.830
See you next time!
